Package: spaced-meta
Version: 8.26.9
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Spaced Linux Team
Depends: base-files, flatpak, libfuse2t64, spaced-mate-default-settings (= 8.26.9), spaced-welcome (>= 0.1.9)
Provides: spaced-release
Breaks: base-files (<< 13)
Replaces: base-files (<< 13)
Description: Spaced Linux release version tracking
 Tracks the Spaced Linux release version and independently maintained Welcome
 package so that in-place OS updates deliver the complete desktop. The
 installed version is written to /etc/os-release, and upgrading this package
 upgrades the reported Spaced Linux version to match the release.
